    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thanks to many adventurers visiting our Eden Group, we've recently prepared a new version of Eden Group Mark for our visitors.",
      "translation" : "感謝許多冒險者加入樂園團。我們最近為訪客準備了新版樂園團徽章。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And it is also possible to exchange old version of Eden Group Mark into a new one.",
      "translation" : "舊版徽章也可以兌換成新版。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lime Evenor]",
      "translation" : "[萊姆·艾弗諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Though it has a slight time delay, this new version of Eden Group Mark will send you back to current saved location.",
      "translation" : "雖然兌換後需要稍等片刻，但新版樂園團徽章可以把你傳送回當前儲存點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Would you like to exchange yours?",
      "translation" : "要兌換嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sure",
      "translation" : "好"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm good.",
      "translation" : "不用了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lime Evenor]",
      "translation" : "[萊姆·艾弗諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Secretary Lime Evenor",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What possible reason would you have... to not exchange?",
      "translation" : "您為什麼不想兌換呢...？"
